P_Init: Init Playloop state.␀␀␀S_Init: Setting up sound.␀␀␀D_CheckNetGame: Checking network game status.␀␀␀HU_Init: Setting up heads up display.␀␀␀ST_Init: Init status bar.␀␀␀map01␀␀␀-statdump␀␀␀External statistics registered.␀-record␀Init MainLoop playdemo␀␀Init MainLoop timedemo␀␀Init MainLoop␀␀␀1.666␀␀␀Doom 1.7/1.7a␀␀␀1.7␀Doom 1.8␀␀␀␀1.8␀Doom 1.9␀␀␀␀1.9␀Hacx␀␀␀␀hacx␀␀␀␀Ultimate Doom␀␀␀ultimate␀␀␀␀Final Doom␀␀final␀␀␀Final Doom (alt)␀␀␀␀final2␀␀Chex Quest␀␀chex␀␀␀␀Player 1 left the game␀␀-left␀␀␀-right␀␀-longtics␀␀␀-solo-net␀␀␀NOTE: Turning resolution is reduced; this is probably because there is a client recording a Vanilla demo.␀␀␀startskill %i  deathmatch: %i  startmap: %i  startepisode: %i
